OpenLambda real-robot collection

The source decoding, checksummed record format, MPEG-TS timestamp parser,
physical schema validation and offline nearest-source alignment are adapted
from the g1-control-platform recording/ and gopro/ components. This release
extracts those components, replaces dashboard/process/OSS dependencies with a
standalone CLI, adds a read-only ROS hand observer, and exports timestamped
Parquet/MP4 without the original GR00T/LeRobot exporter.

